<h1>Contact 0stakes</h1>

<p>
  Questions, corrections, bug reports, or ideas for a new game or strategy guide? We read
  every message.
</p>

<h2>Email</h2>
<p>
  <a href="mailto:info@0stakes.com">info@0stakes.com</a>
</p>
<p>
  We aim to reply within <b>2 to 3 business days</b>. Please include the page address
  (URL) you're writing about and, for bugs, your device and browser.
</p>

<h2>Quick feedback form</h2>
<p>
  Prefer a form? The <a href="/feedback/">feedback form</a> lets you report a bug, suggest
  a feature or game, or request an article, with an optional email address if you'd like a reply.
</p>

<h2>What to write to us about</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Bugs and errors:</b> something in a game doesn't behave correctly, or a payout, rule, or odds figure looks wrong. Accuracy matters here, so corrections are especially welcome.</li>
  <li><b>Suggestions:</b> a game, strategy, simulation, or article you'd like to see.</li>
  <li><b>Business and advertising enquiries:</b> partnerships, sponsorships, or press.</li>
  <li><b>Privacy requests:</b> access, deletion, or opt-out requests. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</li>
  <li><b>Copyright or content concerns:</b> tell us what the content is and where it appears, and we'll look into it promptly.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Good to know</h2>
<ul>
  <li>0stakes is practice only. There is no real-money gambling and no deposits or withdrawals (optional accounts only hold play chips with no cash value), so we can't help with casino accounts, winnings, or payouts at other sites.</li>
  <li>We can't give personal financial or gambling advice.</li>
  <li>If gambling is a problem for you or someone you know, call <b>1-800-GAMBLER</b> or visit <a href="https://www.ncpgambling.org" rel="noopener">ncpgambling.org</a>.</li>
</ul>

